<title>UK: J.P. Morgan adds 100 mln Sfr to Dec 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>J.P. Morgan adds 100 mln Sfr to Dec 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   J.P. MORGAN AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.0	 MATURITY    27.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.80     PAY DATE    27.MAY.97</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 5	   LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	ORIGINAL 150 MLN SFR BOND LAUNCHED 28.JAN.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
